    "@value" : "This relation is modeled after the BFO relation of the same name which was in BFO2, but is used in a more restricted sense - specifically, we model this relation as functional (inherited from characteristic-of). Note that this relation is now removed from BFO2020."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
