  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "DEPRECATED The axiom that mechanical property has realization some application of mechanical load treats only conventional materials and not such effects as magnetostriction etc."
